{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-heb-11-1","title":"Hebrews 11:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 What faith is. 6 Without faith we cannot please God. 7 The worthy fruits thereof in the fathers of old time.</p>\n<p>faith. 13; 10:22,39; Ac 20:21; 1Co 13:13; Ga 5:6; Tit 1:1; 1Pe 1:7; 2Pe 1:1 is the. Ps 27:13; 42:11 substance. or, ground, or, confidence. 2:3; 3:14; 2Co 9:4; 11:17; *Gr: hoped. 6:12,18,19 the evidence. 7,27; Ro 8:24,25; 2Co 4:18; 5:17; 1Pe 1:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-11-2","title":"Hebrews 11:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>the elders. 4-39</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-11-3","title":"Hebrews 11:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>faith. 1:2; Ge 1:1-31; 2:1; Ps 33:6; Isa 40:26; Jer 10:11,16; Joh 1:3 Ac 14:15; 17:24; Ro 1:19-21; 4:17; 2Pe 3:5; Re 4:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-11-4","title":"Hebrews 11:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>faith. Ge 4:3-5,15,25; 1Jo 3:11,12 a more. 9:22; Pr 15:8; 21:27; Tit 1:16; Jude 1:11 he obtained. Le 9:24; 1Ki 18:38; Mt 23:35; Lu 11:51 and by. 12:1,24; Ge 4:10; Mt 23:35 yet speaketh. or, is yet spoken of.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-11-5","title":"Hebrews 11:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Enoch. Ge 5:22-24; Lu 3:37; Jude 1:14 translated. 2Ki 2:11; Ps 89:48; Joh 8:51,52 and was. 2Ki 2:16,17; Jer 36:26; Re 11:9-12 this testimony. 3,4 that he. 6; Ge 5:22; Ro 8:8,9; 1Th 2:4; 1Jo 3:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-11-6","title":"Hebrews 11:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":11,